  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zen-browser/desktop/zipball/1.22.3b",
  "body": "# Zen Stable Release\n\n\n## New Features\n- Updated to Firefox 156.0.1\n- The command bar now allows you to search through tabs and folders more efficiently.\n\n## Fixes\n- Fixed Zen leaking system handles on Windows as content processes were started and stopped.\n- Fixed context menu actions on the urlbar not working. ([#15437](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15437))\n- Fixed overflow-extension order in single toolbar mode. ([#15419](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15419))\n- Fixed not being able to install add-ons while in compact mode. ([#15445](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15445))\n- Fixed Zen windows on macOS 27 immediately returning to maximized after being restored by double-clicking the title bar.\n- Other bug fixes and improvements.\n",
